This product includes a MoonBit port of the Noise Protocol Framework handshake
state machine. The port follows the structure of snow:

  https://github.com/mcginty/snow
  Copyright Jake McGinty and contributors
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
  or the MIT License, at your option.

Cryptographic primitives are provided by mooncry where noted in the README:

  https://github.com/cc06b/mooncry
  Copyright 2026 Solo Crypto Contributors
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

BLAKE2s-256 and HMAC-BLAKE2s are implemented in this repository. BLAKE2s is
RFC 7693. mooncry 0.95.0's BLAKE2s is not used because it appends an extra
empty block when the input length is a positive multiple of 64 bytes.

Applicable Cacophony test vectors are vendored from snow's
tests/vectors/cacophony.txt. The original suite is
https://github.com/centromere/cacophony (Unlicense).
